OL,6,
OL,7,FKing Charles III makes visit to
OL,8,FLancashire
OL,10,FHe will make a number of stops during
OL,11,Fthe day, including to cultural venues
OL,12,Fand food producers
OL,14,FThe King was last in the county in
OL,15,FFebruary, when he visited Clitheroe
OL,17,FToday's visit will mostly focus on the
OL,18,FPreston area
OL,20,FAmong his many titles and stylings, the
OL,21,FKing is also the Duke of Lancaster
